Hello Lisa and Team,

I agree that collaborating with influencers and hosting a pre-event meetup are great ways to generate buzz and engagement. I also like the idea of creating an email series to showcase our new office and team. However, I think we should prioritize the social media campaign, as this is the most effective and cost-efficient way to reach our target audience. Social media is also where we can leverage our existing followers and encourage them to spread the word.

I suggest we focus on the following tasks for the social media campaign:

- Create a catchy and memorable hashtag for the event
- Develop a content calendar with a mix of informative, entertaining, and promotional posts
- Design eye-catching graphics and videos to showcase our new office and services
- Launch a contest or giveaway to incentivize participation and sharing
- Monitor and respond to comments and feedback
- Track and measure the results and impact of our campaign

What do you think? Do you have any suggestions or feedback on this plan? Please let me know by Friday, so we can finalize the strategy and start executing it.

I look forward to hearing from you soon.

Omar


